00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:43.430
of Ireland. To Dr. Colin Campbell, the facts about our oil supply are simple.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:48.890
Despite searching the world with all the advances in technology and knowledge and incentive

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:55.530
and everything, we've been finding less and less for 40 years. And in 1981 was a kind

00:05:55.530 --> 00:06:00.000
of turning point when we started using more than we found in new fields.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:04.050
as we started sucking down what had been found in the past,

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.800
eating into our inheritance, you could say.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.320
So I don't think there's really any serious doubt

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:12.850
that we're close to this turning point,

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.250
the sort of turning point for mankind, you could say,

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.850
when this critical energy for agriculture in particular,

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:23.610
which means food, which means people, is heading on down.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.280
And there's a huge debate raging of exactly the date

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.670
